# user wavetables (sample.h SMP_E_WT: the bank's raw frames; tests/fixtures/wtbank.bin, made by sampleio.py: a tone,
# "saw sine" of 16 frames and "pulse" of 8): jacquard's table knob past its nine reaches U1 and U2 and no further; the
# tone is user sample 1, the tables no sample slots
wait 300
samples tests/fixtures/wtbank.bin
wait 300
knob 2 engine jacquard
expect par2.engine 2
knob 2 e1 9
expect par2.e1 9
knob 2 e1 10
expect par2.e1 10
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
turn K1 5
expect par2.e1 10
turn K1 -1
expect par2.e1 9
play 2 C4 on 110
wait 200
play 2 C4 off
wait 100
